<title>USA: Thermal Industries Q1 share $0.66 vs $0.35.</title>
<headline>Thermal Industries Q1 share $0.66 vs $0.35.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>THERMAL INDUSTRIES INC.</p>
<p>				 Quarter ended September 30,</p>
<p>					  1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Net Sales		  $13,477,000	     $10,510,000</p>
<p>    Net Income		   1,298,000		   690,000</p>
<p>    Net Income Per Share	    $.66			$.35</p>
<p>COMMENTS:  Increase in net income is due to 28% increase in billings for the quarter.  Windows are selling at a record pace and new products are also contributing.  October orders and billings are strong.</p>
</text>
